<title>POLAND: JELFA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 4.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.59 vs   2.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.63 vs   3.00</p>
